 posted library access and noise rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-library-tcc-music-media","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Teacher Curriculum Center/Music & Media","title":"Work Alongside Teaching and Media Collections","subtitle":"Second-floor east-wing space for study and collection-based research","notes":"Set up here when an assignment draws on teaching materials, juvenile literature, music, or media, and check service availability before seeking staff help.","short_summary":"A collection-centered study environment suited to education, music, and media coursework.","evidence_claim":"CSUN describes the Teacher Curriculum Center/Music & Media on the second-floor east wing as an environment for study, research, relaxation, and personal enjoyment.","source_url":"https://catalog.csun.edu/about/colleges/lib/","source_title":"Library | California State University, Northridge Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on the second floor, east wing. Service-point hours may differ from building hours, so verify current availability before requesting materials or assistance.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-learning-resource-center","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Learning Resource Center","title":"Pair Study Time with Academic Support","subtitle":"Third-floor east-wing tutoring and writing support","notes":"Bring the assignment, course instructions, and a working draft or problem set; schedule ahead when possible, since walk-in help is not guaranteed.","short_summary":"An academic-support setting for writing consultations, subject tutoring, workshops, and collaborative learning.","evidence_claim":"CSUN locates the Learning Resource Center on the University Library’s third-floor east wing and says it provides tutoring, supplementa